<h1 class="font_0" style="text-align: center;"><span class="color_18">Компьютерная помощь и ремонт компьютеров в Астане</span></h1>
<figure id="attachment_8058" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-8058" style="width: 249px" class="wp-caption alignright"><img class="size-full wp-image-8058" src="https://pc-help-astana.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/2020-02-08_08-04-21.png" alt="Починка ноутбуков: матрицы, клавиатуры, зарядки." width="249" height="169" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-8058" class="wp-caption-text">Починка ноутбуков: матрицы, клавиатуры, зарядки.</figcaption></figure>
<p class="font8"><span class="word">Компьютер</span> <span class="word">является</span> <span class="word">не</span> <span class="word">простым</span> <span class="word">устройством</span>, <span class="word">следовательно</span>, <span class="word">ремонтом</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">поправками</span> <span class="word">должен</span> <span class="word">заниматься</span> <span class="word">грамотный</span> <span class="word">специалист</span>. <span class="word">Если</span> <span class="word">владелец</span> <span class="word">компьютера</span> <span class="word">при</span> <span class="word">его</span> <span class="word">не</span> <span class="word">исправности</span> <span class="word">пытается</span> <span class="word">сам</span> <span class="word">что</span>&#8211;<span class="word">то</span> <span class="word">предпринять</span>, <span class="word">то</span>, <span class="word">как</span> <span class="word">правило</span>, <span class="word">все</span> <span class="word">это</span> <span class="word">не</span> <span class="word">приносит</span> <span class="word">результата</span>, <span class="word">а</span> <span class="word">где</span>&#8211;<span class="word">то</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">во</span> <span class="word">вред</span> <span class="word">себе</span>. <span class="word">Так</span> <span class="word">же</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">не</span> <span class="word">принесет</span> <span class="word">пользу</span> <span class="word">псевдо</span>&#8211;<span class="word">програмист</span> <span class="word">в</span> <span class="word">лице</span> <span class="word">ваших</span> <span class="word">знакомых</span> <span class="word">которые</span> <span class="word">считают</span> <span class="word">что</span> <span class="word">в</span> <span class="word">этом</span> <span class="word">нет</span> <span class="word">ничего</span> <span class="word">сложного</span>.</p>
<p><span class="word">Ваш</span> <span class="word">компьютер</span> <span class="word">не</span> <span class="word">функционирует</span>, <span class="word">вы</span> <span class="word">не</span> <span class="word">можете</span> <span class="word">сделать</span> <span class="word">кое</span>&#8211;<span class="word">какие</span> <span class="word">операции</span>, <span class="word">то</span> <span class="word">правильным</span> <span class="word">решением</span> <span class="word">для</span> <span class="word">Вас</span> <span class="word">будет</span> <span class="word">обратиться</span> <span class="word">к</span> <span class="word">специалисту</span>.</p>
<p><span class="word">При</span> <span class="word">отсутствии</span> <span class="word">такого</span> <span class="word">специалиста</span> <span class="word">среди</span> <span class="word">Ваших</span> <span class="word">друзей</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">знакомых</span>, <span class="word">Вы</span> <span class="word">ищите</span> <span class="word">его</span> <span class="word">в</span> <span class="word">рекламных</span> <span class="word">объявлениях</span>. <span class="word">При</span> <span class="word">поиске</span> <span class="word">не</span> <span class="word">торопитесь</span> <span class="word">доверить</span> <span class="word">Ваш</span> <span class="word">компьютер</span> <span class="word">первому</span> <span class="word">попавшему</span>, <span class="word">не</span> <span class="word">просмотрев</span> <span class="word">оценки</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">отзывы</span> <span class="word">о</span> <span class="word">его</span> <span class="word">работе</span>.</p>
<p><span class="word">Компьютерный</span> <span class="word">сервис</span></p>
<p><span class="word">Многие</span> <span class="word">люди</span> <span class="word">в</span> <span class="word">наше</span> <span class="word">время</span> <span class="word">используют</span> <span class="word">компьютер</span> <span class="word">повседневно</span> <span class="word">в</span> <span class="word">работе</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">для</span> <span class="word">развлечений</span>. <span class="word">Компьютер</span> <span class="word">стал</span> <span class="word">неотъемлемой</span> <span class="word">частью</span> <span class="word">будни</span> <span class="word">человека</span>. <span class="word">Следовательно</span>, <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">растет</span> <span class="word">огромное</span> <span class="word">количество</span> <span class="word">сервизов</span> <span class="word">предоставляющие</span> <span class="word">как</span> <span class="word">технические</span> <span class="word">так</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">механические</span> <span class="word">ремонтные</span> <span class="word">услуги</span>. <span class="word">Приобретение</span> <span class="word">будь</span> <span class="word">то</span> <span class="word">дорогих</span> <span class="word">либо</span> <span class="word">бюджетных</span> <span class="word">компьютерных</span> <span class="word">устройств</span>, <span class="word">при</span> <span class="word">отсутствии</span> <span class="word">своевременного</span> <span class="word">ухода</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">ремонта</span>, <span class="word">настройки</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">полный</span> <span class="word">проверки</span>, <span class="word">становится</span> <span class="word">бесполезным</span>. <span class="word">Для</span> <span class="word">того</span> <span class="word">чтобы</span> <span class="word">избавится</span> <span class="word">от</span> <span class="word">этой</span> <span class="word">головной</span> <span class="word">боли</span> <span class="word">Вам</span> <span class="word">необходим</span> <span class="word">договор</span> <span class="word">с</span> <span class="word">профессионалами</span> <span class="word">которые</span> <span class="word">будут</span> <span class="word">проводить</span> <span class="word">ремонт</span> <span class="word">Вашего</span> <span class="word">компьютерного</span> <span class="word">устройства</span>, <span class="word">а</span> <span class="word">так</span> <span class="word">же</span> <span class="word">входящий</span> <span class="word">в</span> <span class="word">пакет</span> <span class="word">услуг</span> <span class="word">диагностику</span>.  <span class="word">То</span> <span class="word">есть</span> <span class="word">надо</span> <span class="word">понимать</span> <span class="word">что</span> <span class="word">делается</span> <span class="word">не</span> <span class="word">только</span> <span class="word">срочные</span> <span class="word">ремонты</span>, <span class="word">но</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">профилактические</span> <span class="word">проверки</span> <span class="word">для</span> <span class="word">постоянной</span> <span class="word">работы</span> <span class="word">Вашего</span> <span class="word">компьютера</span> <span class="word">в</span> <span class="word">исправном</span> <span class="word">виде</span>. <span class="word">Своевременная</span> <span class="word">проверка</span>, <span class="word">которая</span> <span class="word">происходит</span> <span class="word">периодически</span>, <span class="word">оградит</span> <span class="word">вас</span> <span class="word">от</span> <span class="word">внезапных</span> <span class="word">поломок</span> <span class="word">оборудования</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">остановок</span> <span class="word">в</span> <span class="word">работе</span>. <span class="word">Мы</span> <span class="word">предоставляем</span> <span class="word">компьютерный</span> <span class="word">сервис</span> <span class="word">как</span> <span class="word">на</span> <span class="word">основе</span> <span class="word">договора</span>, <span class="word">так</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">на</span> <span class="word">основе</span> <span class="word">единичной</span> <span class="word">процедуры</span>. <span class="word">Сюда</span> <span class="word">же</span> <span class="word">входит</span> <span class="word">чистка</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">смазка</span> <span class="word">деталей</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">узлов</span> <span class="word">устройства</span>, <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">их</span> <span class="word">замена</span> <span class="word">при</span> <span class="word">надобности</span>.  <span class="word">Для</span> <span class="word">мер</span> <span class="word">предосторожности</span> <span class="word">очищается</span> <span class="word">пыль</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">устанавливается</span> <span class="word">нормализация</span> <span class="word">рабочих</span> <span class="word">узлов</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">прочие</span> <span class="word">нужные</span> <span class="word">процедуры</span>. <span class="word">В</span> <span class="word">обязательном</span> <span class="word">порядке</span> <span class="word">делается</span> <span class="word">диагностика</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">оценка</span> <span class="word">функциональности</span> <span class="word">устройства</span>.</p>
<p><span class="word">Компьютерная</span> <span class="word">помощь</span>: <span class="word">алгоритм</span> <span class="word">оформления</span> <span class="word">услуги</span></p>
<p><span class="word">Приходит</span> <span class="word">наш</span> <span class="word">сотрудник</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">производит</span> <span class="word">диагностику</span> <span class="word">устройства</span>. <span class="word">После</span> <span class="word">выяснение</span> <span class="word">причины</span> <span class="word">поломки</span> <span class="word">проговаривается</span> <span class="word">стоимость</span> <span class="word">исправление</span> <span class="word">данной</span> <span class="word">поломки</span>, <span class="word">соответствующая</span> <span class="word">нашим</span> <span class="word">с</span> <span class="word">прайсом</span> <span class="word">листом</span>, <span class="word">вы</span> <span class="word">же</span> <span class="word">в</span> <span class="word">свою</span> <span class="word">очередь</span> <span class="word">озвучиваете</span> <span class="word">согласие</span> <span class="word">или</span> <span class="word">же</span> <span class="word">не</span> <span class="word">согласие</span> <span class="word">с</span> <span class="word">данными</span> <span class="word">условиями</span>. <span class="word">Все</span> <span class="word">работы</span> <span class="word">с</span> <span class="word">вашим</span> <span class="word">устройством</span> <span class="word">делаются</span> <span class="word">строго</span> <span class="word">по</span> <span class="word">вашему</span> <span class="word">согласию</span>.</p>
<figure id="attachment_8059" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-8059" style="width: 247px" class="wp-caption alignright"><img class="size-full wp-image-8059" src="https://pc-help-astana.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/2020-02-08_08-11-38.png" alt="Установка Антивирусного приложения" width="247" height="165" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-8059" class="wp-caption-text">Установка Антивирусного приложения</figcaption></figure>
<p><span class="word">Плюсы</span> <span class="word">компании</span> «<span class="word">PC</span>&#8211;<span class="word">HELP</span>»<br />
<span class="word">Вы</span> <span class="word">живете</span> <span class="word">или</span> <span class="word">гость</span> <span class="word">города</span> <span class="word">Нур</span>&#8211;<span class="word">Султан</span>, <span class="word">у</span> <span class="word">вас</span> <span class="word">случилась</span> <span class="word">поломка</span> <span class="word">вашего</span> <span class="word">ПК</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">вы</span> <span class="word">решаете</span> <span class="word">обратиться</span> <span class="word">в</span> <span class="word">нашу</span> <span class="word">компанию</span> &#8211; <span class="word">то</span> <span class="word">вы</span> <span class="word">получаете</span> <span class="word">следующие</span> <span class="word">плюсы</span>:<br />
•  <span class="word">помощь</span> <span class="word">по</span> <span class="word">телефону</span> <span class="word">бесплатно</span><br />
•  <span class="word">Появление</span> <span class="word">нашего</span> <span class="word">сотрудника</span> <span class="word">у</span> <span class="word">вас</span> <span class="word">не</span> <span class="word">более</span> <span class="word">чем</span> <span class="word">через</span> <span class="word">40</span> <span class="word">минут</span><br />
• <span class="word">предварительное</span> <span class="word">ознакомление</span> <span class="word">с</span> <span class="word">нашими</span> <span class="word">ценами</span><br />
• <span class="word">гарантия</span> <span class="word">сделанных</span> <span class="word">нами</span> <span class="word">работ</span><br />
• <span class="word">Информирование</span> <span class="word">о</span> <span class="word">сохранности</span><br />
<span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">секретности</span> <span class="word">информации</span> <span class="word">на</span> <span class="word">ПК</span>.</p>
<p><span class="word">Мы</span> <span class="word">всегда</span> <span class="word">готовы</span> <span class="word">облегчить</span> <span class="word">вам</span> <span class="word">головную</span> <span class="word">боль</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">рады</span> <span class="word">решить</span> <span class="word">ваши</span> <span class="word">проблемы</span> <span class="word">связанные</span> <span class="word">со</span> <span class="word">сбоем</span> <span class="word">ПК</span>. <span class="word">Мы</span> <span class="word">пресечем</span> <span class="word">ошибки</span> <span class="word">в</span> <span class="word">работе</span> <span class="word">устройства</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">предоставим</span> <span class="word">вам</span> <span class="word">по</span> <span class="word">ним</span> <span class="word">нужную</span> <span class="word">информацию</span> <span class="word">бесплатно</span>.</p>
<p><span class="word">На</span> <span class="word">заметку</span>, <span class="word">подчеркнем</span> <span class="word">то</span> <span class="word">что</span> <span class="word">наши</span> <span class="word">сотрудники</span> <span class="word">квалифицированные</span>, <span class="word">хорошо</span> <span class="word">обученные</span>, <span class="word">с</span> <span class="word">огромным</span> <span class="word">опытом</span> <span class="word">такого</span> <span class="word">вида</span> <span class="word">работ</span>. <span class="word">Имеют</span> <span class="word">владение</span> <span class="word">по</span> <span class="word">введению</span> <span class="word">программ</span> <span class="word">разного</span> <span class="word">вида</span> <span class="word">сложности</span> <span class="word">и</span> <span class="word">новыми</span> <span class="word">технологиями</span>.<br />
